{"id":"vod_sn_37243","vodId":"37243","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"飙速宅男第三季","name_cn":"飙速宅男第三季","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2ebe94ac6354c601669afc9a485267bd.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在位于千叶县的立总北高中内，小野田坂道（山下大辉 配音）是一名彻头彻尾的御宅族，沉迷于二次元文化之中。在小野田的整个初中时代，他都没有能够找到志同道合的同好，因此他做出了一个决定，那就是一定要在高中加入动漫社。哪知道动漫社因为人员不足而解散了，这让小野田好不容易燃起的斗智宛如浇了一盆冷水。　　一次偶然中，小野田骑着自行车爬坡的姿态被骑行社的今泉俊辅（鸟海浩辅 配音）看到了，今泉是一位经验非常丰富的自行车运动员，从初中时代起就开始参加各类比赛，在小野田的身上，今泉看到了过人的骑行天赋，于是决定游说他加入骑行社。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rC2uiNfFwE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jzfNNNzxys1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rg0ecC0pfP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kQsdzfyags1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yAFWiaSLPm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f18vPCycmM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/823YWx4qj21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BsdqbSZ0Yp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X2smhTbdrw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k8zBs1RuM01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q5e9Cu94wm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hzx2BniFZ61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pc25gdVTJ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5NPe9WFSbu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rs